    "text": "Hardware A transparent record of the hardware evidence still required for a field-facing system. Home Lab Hardware 01 - Need A possible field layer, not a finished device The project is investigating a yeast-based sensing direction, but the reviewed records do not establish a field-device specification, a validated sampling workflow, or a measured readout requirement. Hardware may become useful only after the biological signal, sample preparation, operating conditions, and user needs are supported by evidence. This hidden interim page therefore records missing evidence rather than presenting a conceptual enclosure as a built product. 02 - Design Design evidence currently unavailable Mechanical No verified enclosure drawing, CAD file, sample-handling design, or ergonomic study was located. Readout No verified electronics, optical reader, signal interface, calibration record, or acquisition test was located. Field use No verified power budget, robustness test, costed bill of materials, or field-deployment record was located. DESIGN FILES PENDING BUILD RECORD PENDING TEST DATA PENDING Evidence gate. A public hardware claim requires linked design files, a reproducible build record, and measured test data. 03 - Build No verified prototype or test result No documented hardware prototype, assembly record, bill of materials, or performance test was located in the reviewed evidence. The page remains hidden so that proposal-stage ideas are not mistaken for a fabricated or validated device. Future publication gate Publish only after the team confirms requirements, versioned design files, component sources and costs, assembly instructions, safety review, test methods, raw measurements, limitations, and reproduction permission.",
